{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Water Margin Scrolls</i>, you'll form your own Liangshan squad to take into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/41990168924a5be7930c88c72548ac0e.poster.avif?t=1768457915\" width=800 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/41990168924a5be7930c88c72548ac0e.webm?t=1768457915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/41990168924a5be7930c88c72548ac0e.mp4?t=1768457915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up Your Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your heroes' stats and abilities using herbs and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/749c1cb278485342b04320fb82d32b04.poster.avif?t=1768457915\" width=800 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/749c1cb278485342b04320fb82d32b04.webm?t=1768457915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/749c1cb278485342b04320fb82d32b04.mp4?t=1768457915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auto Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fully automated\u2014victory depends on how well you build and position your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/08abf3e458dfa041bb96d5288f121c07.poster.avif?t=1768457915\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/08abf3e458dfa041bb96d5288f121c07.webm?t=1768457915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/08abf3e458dfa041bb96d5288f121c07.mp4?t=1768457915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot and Recruit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Story Mode, you\u2019ll have a chance to recruit legendary heroes from <i>Water Margin</i> and add them to your personal deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/b56cac99906ee8fe360112c99c410f51.avif?t=1768457915\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras_big/b56cac99906ee8fe360112c99c410f51.avif?t=1768457915 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the [Collection] feature to build your own deck and discover powerful synergies between characters and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/e38b10e7c5ff71b815c0ef5b58edb697.avif?t=1768457915\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to Wishlist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the <strong>Add to Wishlist</strong> button abov